  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Changed\n• SignatureMedian.BoundaryMode.Adaptive - Eliminated phase shift near sequence edges.\n• Before : Slid a full-width window inside [0, N ... 1], shifting the window centre away from index i near boundaries (up to ±offsetLow phase distortion, duplicate outputs at edges).\n• After : Window stays centred on i; reach shrinks symmetrically via Math.Min(offsetLow, Math.Min(i, n - 1 - i)). Zero phase shift, no synthetic samples.\n• Scope : SignatureMedian.vb (Adaptive branch + enum XML comment), README.md, AvocadoSmoothie_API_Reference.md, AvocadoSmoothie.Barista.xml. No changes to FrmMain.vb - the UI path (GetSelectedBoundaryMode() → btnCalibrate_Click / btnExport_Click → ComputeMediansByRadius) picks up the fix automatically.\n• Compatibility : Public API signatures unchanged. Boundary-region output values will differ from prior versions when Adaptive is selected.",
